#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0044 expect=violation domain=ADLBC
#note "Both ATM/ADTM populated, ADTM time part (09:30:00) differs from ATM (08:30:00) -> time_part(*DTM)!=*TM fires on row 1. TWO expansions exist ({*=A} real pair, {*=AD} ADTM/ADDTM where ADDTM is absent and folds to broadcast FALSE), aggregated count is 1, exactly as the green CDISC twin cdisc/CDISC-AD0044/CDISC-AD0044-invalid-ADLBC.cdt pins it. Do NOT add or remove a TM/DTM column to 'fix' the count."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 USUBJID=01-701-1015 ATM=08:30:00 ADTM=2012-01-01T09:30:00
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col ATM     type=Char
col ADTM    type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | 08:30:00 | 2012-01-01T09:30:00
